<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Group Five chief executive resigns.</title>
<headline>Group Five chief executive resigns.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Group Five Ltd said on Tuesday that Theunis Kotzee, the firm's chief executive officer, had announced his resignation following policy differences with the board.</p>
<p>Stan Goldstein, chairman of the South African construction and building products group, will assume executive responsibilities until a new appointment is made, Group Five said in a brief statement.</p>
<p>No further details were given.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom 27 11 482 1003</p>
